            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A nossa equipa está a verificar a tua primeira foto. Põe outra primeiro ou espera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photos you added will be deleted, and the others go back as they were." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neu hinzugefügte Fotos werden gelöscht, die anderen bleiben, wie sie waren."
